Package: raking
Title: Optimal Representative Sample Weighting
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("wkt", email = "wktc12@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calibrates survey weights to known population targets using
    regularized raking, following Barratt, Angeris and Boyd (2021)
    "Optimal Representative Sample Weighting". Built on S7 classes with
    vectorized operations.
